    },
    {
      "index": 49,
      "locator": "Notebook 单元 49 · code",
      "text": "#先验概率不等的Bayes线性判别模型\nd123_ld_B=lda(priors=(5/20,8/20,7/20)).fit(X,Y)\nd123['ld_B_G'] = d123_ld_B.predict(X) \nprint(d123)"
